{"3866010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brisca", "steam_appid": 3866010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🃏 Brisca Like Never Before!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate the <strong>10th anniversary</strong> of the most popular <strong>card game by Quarzo Apps</strong> with this fully revamped version of <strong>Brisca</strong>. Enjoy fast-paced, strategic matches in <strong>online multiplayer</strong>, <strong>offline vs AI</strong>, or <strong>practice mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete and customizable experience faithful to the traditional <strong>Spanish card game</strong>, now with improved graphics, powerful new features, and smooth gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 High-definition cards, customizable backs, and smooth animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📱 Play in <strong>portrait or landscape mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎴 Use the <strong>Spanish, French, or Italian (Napoletane) deck</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Smart AI with 4 difficulty levels and configurable rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 <strong>Online multiplayer with friends</strong> or single-player games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔈 Realistic sounds with adjustable volume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎓 Full tutorial and in-game help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Advanced settings: card size, rules, effects, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔋 Graphics optimized for low battery consumption.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ <strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode (with undo option)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player vs AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_p